ight">+65%</span></p></div><div class="relative min-w-0 bg-surface-2/85 px-3 py-2 sm:px-4 sm:py-3" title="Immortality"><p class="truncate font-heading text-[9.5px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-mlbb-text-secondary/85">HP</p><p class="mt-1 font-heading text-[18px] font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-mlbb-text sm:text-[22px]"><span class="text-mlbb-gold-bright">+800</span></p></div><div class="relative min-w-0 bg-surface-2/85 px-3 py-2 sm:px-4 sm:py-3" title="Immortality"><p class="truncate font-heading text-[9.5px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-mlbb-text-secondary/85">Physical Defense</p><p class="mt-1 font-heading text-[18px] font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-mlbb-text sm:text-[22px]"><span class="text-mlbb-gold-bright">+15</span></p></div></div></div><div class="relative mt-4 overflow-hidden border border-mlbb-gold/18 bg-gradient-to-br from-surface-3/75 to-surface-2/85 px-4 py-3.5"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-mlbb-gold/40 to-transparent" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="mb-2.5 flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right-left h-3.5 w-3.5 text-text-accent" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m16 3 4 4-4 4"></path><path d="M20 7H4"></path><path d="m8 21-4-4 4-4"></path><path d="M4 17h16"></path></svg><p class="font-heading text-[10.5px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-text-accent">Situational Swaps</p></div><ul class="space-y-2"><li class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 gap-y-1 text-[12.5px] leading-relaxed text-mlbb-text-secondary"><a class="font-heading font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-mlbb-text transition-colors hover:text-mlbb-gold-bright" href="/items/sea-halberd">Sea Halberd</a><span class="inline-flex items-baseline gap-1.5 text-[11px] up