:linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #FF8C00, transparent)"></div></div></a></div></div></div><div class="mt-6 text-center"><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-text-accent hover:text-text-accent-bright transition-colors font-heading uppercase tracking-wider" href="/heroes">Browse All Heroes<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right w-4 h-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></a></div></section></div></section></div><section class="content-lazy relative border-t border-border-subtle py-12 md:py-16" aria-labelledby="hero-faq-heading"><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","@id":"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/sun#faq","url":"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/sun","inLanguage":"en","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the best Sun build in 2026?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Sun's strongest build centers on Corrosion Scythe, Demon Hunter Sword and Golden Staff as core items, paired with the Assassin Emblem and the Flicker battle spell. The full six-item order, flex options for different matchups, and talent setup are in the build section on this page."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the best emblem for Sun?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The recommended emblem for Sun is Assassin Emblem, set up with the Rupture, Master Assassin and Killing Spree talents. The full emblem and talent breakdown, including alternatives for specific matchups, is in the build section."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What lane and role is Sun in Mobile Legends?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Sun is a Fighter hero, usually played in the EXP Lane and as a Jungler. Role and lane decide which builds, emblems, and counters matter most, all of which are covered on this page."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Who counters Sun?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Sun is countered most by Natan, Joy and Marcel, the heroes with the biggest measured edge against Sun in ranked play. The full counter list, the heroes Sun beats, and game-phase tips are in the counters section."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is Sun hard to play?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Sun is rated Medium difficulty in Mobile Legends. Sun rewards some practice with positioning and combos but stays approachable for most ranked players."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is Sun's win rate this patch?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Sun currently holds a 52.4% win rate, a 1.6% pick rate, and a 21.4% ban rate in ranked Mobile Legends, refreshed daily from match data. Win and pick rates broken down by rank, from Epic to Mythical Glory, are in the rank stats section."}}]}</script><div class="container-mlbb relative z-10"><div class="mb-6 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center border border-mlbb-gold/30 bg-mlbb-gold/10 text-text-accent" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-question-mark h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3"></path><path d="M12 17h.01"></path></svg></span><h2 id="hero-faq-heading" class="font-heading text-xl font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.04em] text-text-accent-bright md:text-2xl">Sun FAQ</h2></div><p class="mb-6 max-w-[80ch] text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-muted md:text-[15px]">Sun is a Fighter hero played in the EXP Lane and as a Jungler.<!-- --> Its strongest build centers on Corrosion Scythe, Demon Hunter Sword, Golden Staff; open the <a class="font-semibold text-text-accent underline decoration-text-accent/30 underline-offset-2 transition-colors hover:text-text-accent-bright" href="/build-simulator?hero=sun&amp;items=swift-boots%2Ccorrosion-scythe%2Cdemon-hunter-sword%2Cgolden-staff%2Csea-halberd%2Cwindtalker&amp;spell=flicker&amp;emblem=assassin&amp;talents=rupture%2Cmaster-assassin%2Ckilling-spree&amp;flex=rose-gold-meteor.windtalker%2Cthunder-belt.windtalker%2Cblade-of-despair.sea-halberd">Sun build simulator</a> for the full item order and final stats, or compare every available loadout on the <a class="font-semibold text-text-accent underline decoration-text-accent/30 underline-offset-2 transition-colors hover:text-text-accent-bright" href="/builds/sun">Sun builds page</a>. <!-- -->See every hero that beats it on the <a class="font-semibold text-text-accent underline decoration-text-accent/30 underline-offset-2 transition-colors hover:text-text-accent-bright" href="/counter/sun">Sun counter page</a>.</p><div class="space-y-3"><div class="glass-card overflow-hidden"><h3 class="text-sm md:text-base font-heading font-semibold"><button id="_R_falubsnnauivbH1_" type="button" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="_R_falubsnnauivb_" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-3 p-5 text-left cursor-pointer text-[#E8E6E3] hover:text-[#C8AA6E] transition-colors"><span>What is the best Sun build in 2026?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 rotate-180 text-[#C8AA6E]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div id="_R_falubsnnauivb_" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_falubsnnauivbH1_" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-200 grid-rows-[1fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="px-5 pb-5 -mt-1"><p class="text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed">Sun&#x27;s strongest build centers on Corrosion Scythe, Demon Hunter Sword and Golden Staff as core items, paired with the Assassin Emblem and the Flicker battle spell. The full six-item order, flex options for different matchups, and talent setup are in the build section on this page.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="glass-card overflow-hidden"><h3 class="text-sm md:text-base font-heading font-semibold"><button id="_R_nalubsnnauivbH1_" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_nalubsnnauivb_" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-3 p-5 text-left cursor-pointer text-[#E8E6E3] hover:text-[#C8AA6E] transition-colors"><span>What is the best emblem for Sun?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 text-[#9BA0B4]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div id="_R_nalubsnnauivb_" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_nalubsnnauivbH1_" inert="" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-200 grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="px-5 pb-5 -mt-1"><p class="text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed">The recommended emblem for Sun is Assassin Emblem, set up with the Rupture, Master Assassin and Killing Spree talents. The full emblem and talent breakdown, including alternatives for specific matchups, is in the build section.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="glass-card overflow-hidden"><h3 class="text-sm md:text-base font-heading font-semibold"><button id="_R_valubsnnauivbH1_" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_valubsnnauivb_" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-3 p-5 text-left cursor-pointer text-[#E8E6E3] hover:text-[#C8AA6E] transition-colors"><span>What lane and role is Sun in Mobile Legends?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 text-[#9BA0B4]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div id="_R_valubsnnauivb_" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_valubsnnauivbH1_" inert="" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-200 grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="px-5 pb-5 -mt-1"><p class="text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed">Sun is a Fighter hero, usually played in the EXP Lane and as a Jungler. Role and lane decide which builds, emblems, and counters matter most, all of which are covered on this page.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="glass-card overflow-hidden"><h3 class="text-sm md:text-base font-heading font-semibold"><button id="_R_17alubsnnauivbH1_" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_17alubsnnauivb_" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-3 p-5 text-left cursor-pointer text-[#E8E6E3] hover:text-[#C8AA6E] transition-colors"><span>Who counters Sun?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 text-[#9BA0B4]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div id="_R_17alubsnnauivb_" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_17alubsnnauivbH1_" inert="" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-200 grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="px-5 pb-5 -mt-1"><p class="text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed">Sun is countered most by Natan, Joy and Marcel, the heroes with the biggest measured edge against Sun in ranked play. The full counter list, the heroes Sun beats, and game-phase tips are in the counters section.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="glass-card overflow-hidden"><h3 class="text-sm md:text-base font-heading font-semibold"><button id="_R_1falubsnnauivbH1_" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_1falubsnnauivb_" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-3 p-5 text-left cursor-pointer text-[#E8E6E3] hover:text-[#C8AA6E] transition-colors"><span>Is Sun hard to play?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 text-[#9BA0B4]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div id="_R_1falubsnnauivb_" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_1falubsnnauivbH1_" inert="" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-200 grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="px-5 pb-5 -mt-1"><p class="text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed">Sun is rated Medium difficulty in Mobile Legends. Sun rewards some practice with positioning and combos but stays approachable for most ranked players.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="glass-card overflow-hidden"><h3 class="text-sm md:text-base font-heading font-semibold"><button id="_R_1nalubsnnauivbH1_" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_1nalubsnnauivb_" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-3 p-5 text-left cursor-pointer text-[#E8E6E3] hover:text-[#C8AA6E] transition-colors"><span>What is Sun&#x27;s win rate this patch?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 text-[#9BA0B4]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div id="_R_1nalubsnnauivb_" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_1nalubsnnauivbH1_" inert="" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-200 grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="px-5 pb-5 -mt-1"><p class="text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed">Sun currently holds a 52.4% win rate, a 1.6% pick rate, and a 21.4% ban rate in ranked Mobile Legends, refreshed daily from match data. Win and pick rates broken down by rank, from Epic to Mythical Glory, are in the rank stats section.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></div></main><footer class="content-lazy relative bg-[#000000] border-t border-[#C8AA6E]/20 overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 hex-pattern opacity-40 pointer-events-none"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none" style="background:radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 60% at 50% 100%, rgba(200,170,110,0.03), transparent)"></div><div class="absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-[2px] z-10 overflow-hidden energy-line" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="relative z-10 pt-4 pb-4"><div class="container-mlbb"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-x-12 gap-y-8"><div class="col-span-1 sm:col-span-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield w-7 h-7 text-[#C8AA6E]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path></svg><span class="font-heading text-xl font-bold tracking-wider text-gradient-gold">MLBB<span class="text-gradient-blue">Hub</span></span></div><p class="mb-6 max-w-sm border-l-2 border-mlbb-gold-bright/70 pl-3 font-heading text-base font-semibold uppercase leading-snug tracking-[0.1em] text-text-accent-bright">Win with data, not drama.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-6"><a href="