\",\"text\":\"Purchase Demon Hunter Sword (2,180 gold) as item 3 in the Anti-Tank Frontline build for Sun.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/sun#build-exp-anti-tank\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":4,\"name\":\"Buy Golden Staff\",\"text\":\"Purchase Golden Staff (2,000 gold) as item 4 in the Anti-Tank Frontline build for Sun.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/sun#build-exp-anti-tank\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":5,\"name\":\"Buy Malefic Roar\",\"text\":\"Purchase Malefic Roar (2,060 gold) as item 5 in the Anti-Tank Frontline build for Sun.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/sun#build-exp-anti-tank\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":6,\"name\":\"Buy Immortality\",\"text\":\"Purchase Immortality (2,120 gold) as item 6 in the Anti-Tank Frontline build for Sun.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/sun#build-exp-anti-tank\"}],\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/sun\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-04-20T00:00:00.000Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-05-15T00:00:00.000Z\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"MLBBHub\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com\"}}60:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$64\"}}]\n61:[\"$\",\"$L65\",null,{\"hero\":{\"id\":27,\"name\":\"Sun\",\"slug\":\"sun\",\"title\":\"Monkey King\",\"role\":[\"Fighter\"],\"specialty\":[\"Push\",\"Damage\"],\"lane\":[\"EXP\",\"Jungle\"],\"tier\":\"A\",\"difficulty\":2,\"releaseYear\":2016,\"stats\":{\"durability\":50,\"offense\":50,\"controlEffect\":10,\"difficulty\":50},\"winRate\":52.35,\"pickRate\":1.59,\"banRate\":21.35,\"counters\":{\"strongAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"franco\",\"heroName\":\"Franco\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Sun can deal great sustained damage and has armor-busting capabilities, making him a good counter to tanks with low damage output, such as Franco and Gatotkaca.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"gatotkaca\",\"heroName\":\"Gatotkaca\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Sun can deal great sustained damage and has armor-busting capabilities, making him a good counter to tanks with low damage output, such as Franco and Gatotkaca.\"}],\"weakAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"ruby\",\"heroName\":\"Ruby\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Fighter heroes with Lifesteal can counter Sun, however. For example, heroes like Ruby can steal a lot of HP by hitting Sun and his Dopplegangers.\"}]},\"splashArt\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/file/mlbb/homepage/100_5dd440a371270f458071305b9bf107b5.jpg\",\"portrait\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_117b5cdcc13232157075ce7b7f6177e9.png\",\"skills\":{\"skills\":[{\"name\":\"Simian God\",\"type\":\"Passive\",\"description\":\"Enemies hit by Sun or his Doppelgangers will have their Physical Defense reduced by 5% (stacks up to 6 times). Sun recovers HP equal to 75 plus 15% of the Doppelganger's Physical Attack each time a Doppelganger deals damage.\\nSun or his Doppelgangers' Basic Attacks deal 65 extra damage to creeps.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Enemies hit by Sun or his Doppelgangers will have their \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Defense\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" reduced by 5% (stacks up to 6 times). Sun recovers HP equal to 75 plus 15% of the Doppelganger's Physical Attack each time a Doppelganger deals damage.\\nSun or his Doppelgangers' Basic Attacks deal 65 extra damage to creeps.\"}],\"cooldown\":null,\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_6d93eddf722334375d384ee8965f95f7.png\",\"tags\":[\"Debuff\",\"Heal\"]},{\"name\":\"Endless Variety\",\"type\":\"Skill 1\",\"description\":\"Sun hurls his Golden Staff in the target direction, dealing 280 (+40% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies in its path. Upon hitting an enemy hero or creep or reaching maximum range, the Golden Staff morphs into a Doppelganger that pursues enemies. The Doppelganger inherits Sun's attributes, deals 60% damage, and takes 150% damage for 5s.\\n\\nThis skill shares its level and cooldown with Swift Exchange.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Sun hurls his \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Golden Staff\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" in the target direction, dealing 280\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+40% Total Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" to enemies in its path. Upon hitting an enemy hero or creep or reaching maximum range, the \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Golden Staff\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" morphs into a \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Doppelganger\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" that pursues enemies. The \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Doppelganger\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" inherits Sun's attributes, deals 60% damage, and takes 150% damage for 5s.\\n\\nThis skill shares its level and cooldown with \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Swift Exchange\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\".\"}],\"cooldown\":\"6.5s\",\"manaCost\":\"70\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_0d813a2495b9950a4a57fb9e750212ba.png\",\"tags\":[\"Summon\",\"AOE\"]},{\"name\":\"Swift Exchange\",\"type\":\"Skill 2\",\"description\":\"Sun hurls his Golden Staff in the target direction, dealing 280 (+40% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies in its path.\\n\\nHe conjures a Doppelganger at his location that inherits his attributes, deals 60% damage, and takes 150% damage for 5s.\\nSun transforms into the Golden Staff and becomes concealed, reappearing at its maximum range.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Sun hurls his \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Golden Staff\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" in the target direction, dealing 280\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+40% Total Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" to enemies in its path.\\n\\nHe conjures a \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Doppelganger\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" at his location that inherits his attributes, deals 60% damage, and takes 150% damage for 5s.\\nSun transforms into the \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Golden Staff\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" and becomes concealed, reappearing at its maximum range.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"6.5s\",\"manaCost\":\"70\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_7afa1977abd09809a0cfacccfd2f5cfd.png\",\"tags\":[\"Mobility\",\"Summon\"]},{\"name\":\"Instantaneous Move\",\"type\":\"Skill 3\",\"description\":\"Sun commands his Doppelgangers to strike at the target enemy with him, dealing 270 (+40% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage and slowing the target and enemies behind them by 25% (can be stacked) for 1.5s. This counts as Basic Attack damage and can trigger Attack Effects but cannot Crit.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Sun commands his Doppelgangers to strike at the target enemy with him, dealing 270\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+40% Total Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" and slowing the target and enemies behind them by 25% (can be stacked) for 1.5s. This counts as Basic Attack damage and can trigger Attack Effects but cannot Crit.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"5s\",\"manaCost\":\"40\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_871502bcbd804479198c0374db30dd5a.png\",\"tags\":[\"Burst\",\"Mobility\"]},{\"name\":\"Clone Techniques\",\"type\":\"Ultimate\",\"description\":\"Sun summons a Doppelganger that inherits his attributes, deals 80% damage, and takes 120% damage for 8s.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Sun summons a \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Doppelganger\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" that inherits his attributes, deals 80% damage, and takes 120% damage for 8s.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"32s\",\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_18d2d2e16311dff12a1a8518fc823e4d.png\",\"tags\":[\"Summon\"]}],\"skillUpgradePriority\":\"4-1-2-3\"},\"synergies\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"belerick\",\"heroName\":\"Belerick\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"Pair Sun with tanks who have strong CC abilities such as Belerick or Tigreal to create opportunities for Sun to deal damage.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"tigreal\",\"heroName\":\"Tigreal\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"Pair Sun with tanks who have strong CC abilities such as Belerick or Tigreal to create opportunities for Sun to deal damage.\"}],\"combos\":[{\"type\":\"teamfight\",\"title\":\"TEAMFIGHT COMBOS\",\"description\":\"In teamfights, Sun can start with his Ultimate to summon a Doppelganger, and approach the enemy with his 2nd Skill. Finally, he can use his 2nd Skill and Basic Attacks to deal damage.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":2730,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_18d2d2e16311dff12a1a8518fc823e4d.png\"},{\"skillId\":2750,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_7afa1977abd09809a0cfacccfd2f5cfd.png\"},{\"skillId\":2720,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_871502bcbd804479198c0374db30dd5a.png\"},{\"skillId\":2700,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f98d2e98eaebfb31c6c5101cf1c3201a.png\"}]},{\"type\":\"laning\",\"title\":\"LANING COMBOS\",\"description\":\"Use Sun's 1st Skill to chip away at enemies, and close the distance once they're low on HP with his 2nd Skill. Then use his 3rd Skill to deal a burst of damage with his Dopplegangers. Sun can start with his Ultimate to summon a Doppleganger, then Blink on the enemy with his 2nd Skill, and finally use his 3rd Skill and Basic Attacks finish them off.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":2710,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_0d813a2495b9950a4a57fb9e750212ba.png\"},{\"skillId\":2750,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_7afa1977abd09809a0cfacccfd2f5cfd.png\"},{\"skillId\":2720,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_871502bcbd804479198c0374db30dd5a.png\"},{\"skillId\":2700,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f98d2e98eaebfb31c6c5101cf1c3201a.png\"}]}],\"metaDescription\":\"Sun build, counter, and strategy guide for Mobile Legends. Corrosion Scythe plus Demon Hunter Sword spike, side-lane pressure rules, and draft traps now.\",\"builds\":[],\"overviewLede\":\"Sun is a fighter who wins games by making the map wider than the enemy draft can comfortably cover. He is not a blind EXP answer and he is not your cleanest 5v5 starter. Pick him when the enemy lacks fast clone clear, and when your team can turn side-lane pressure into a real objective lead.\"},\"serverLocale\":\"en\",\"curatedBuilds\":{\"source\":\"curated\",\"hero\":\"sun\",\"patch\":\"2.1.67\",\"lastReviewed\":\"2026-05-15\",\"stalePatch\":true,\"currentPatch\":\"2.2.16a\",\"builds\":[{\"slot\":1,\"id\":\"exp-default\",\"name\":\"EXP Lane Default\",\"roleContext\":\"EXP\",\"items\":[{\"slug\":\"swift-boots\",\"name\":\"Swift Boots\",\"cost\":710,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"corrosion-scythe\",\"name\":\"Corrosion Scythe\",\"cost\":2050,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"demon-hunter-sword\",\"name\":\"Demon Hunter Sword\",\"cost\":2180,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"golden-staff\",\"name\":\"Golden Staff\",\"cost\":2000,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"sea-halberd\",\"name\":\"Sea Halberd\",\"cost\":2050,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"windtalker\",\"name\":\"Windtalker\",\"cost\":1880,\"fixed\":false}],\"coreItems\":[{\"slug\":\"corrosion-scythe\",\"name\":\"Corrosion Scythe\"},{\"slug\":\"demon-hunter-sword\",\"name\":\"Demon Hunter Sword\"},{\"slug\":\"golden-staff\",\"name\":\"Golden Staff\"}],\"emblem\":{\"slug\":\"assassin\",\"name\":\"Assassin Emblem\",\"talents\":[{\"slug\":\"rupture\",\"name\":\"Rupture\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/rupture.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"master-assassin\",\"name\":\"Master Assassin\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/master-assassin.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"killing-spree\",\"name\":\"Killing Spree\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/killing-spree.png\",\"bucket\":\"core\"}]},\"spell\":{\"slug\":\"flicker\",\"name\":\"Flicker\"},\"blessing\":null,\"flexItems\":[{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"rose-gold-meteor\",\"name\":\"Rose Gold Meteor\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"windtalker\",\"name\":\"Windtalker\"},\"trigger\":\"Use against magic burst that can reach you before the front line stabilizes.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"thunder-belt\",\"name\":\"Thunder Belt\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"windtalker\",\"name\":\"Windtalker\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when survivability and stickiness matter more than pure attack speed.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"blade-of-despair\",\"name\":\"Blade of Despair\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"sea-halberd\",\"name\":\"Sea Halberd\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when ahead and the enemy draft has no sustain or shield threats to punish.\"}],\"notes\":\"Default EXP lane split-push build. Corrosion Scythe plus Demon Hunter Sword is the two-item spike where clones start sticking and draining. Golden Staff multiplies attack effects across all bodies.\",\"totalCost\":10870,\"statLines\":[{\"key\":\"physatk\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.physicalAttack\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":200,\"sources\":[\"Corrosion Scythe\",\"Demon Hunter Sword\",\"Golden Staff\",\"Sea Halberd\"]},{\"key\":\"critchance\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.criticalChance\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":20,\"sources\":[\"Windtalker\"]},{\"key\":\"attackspeed\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.attackSpeed\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":135,\"sources\":[\"Swift Boots\",\"Corrosion Scythe\",\"Demon Hunter Sword\",\"Golden Staff\",\"Sea Halberd\",\"Windtalker\"]},{\"key\":\"movespeed\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.movementSpeed\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":60,\"sources\":[\"Swift Boots\",\"Windtalker\"]},{\"key\":\"movespeedPct\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.movementSpeed\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":5,\"sources\":[\"Corrosion Scythe\"]}],\"conflicts\":[],\"simulatorUrl\":\"/build-simulator?hero=sun\u0026items=swift-boots%2Ccorrosion-scythe%2Cdemon-hunter-sword%2Cgolden-staff%2Csea-halberd%2Cwindtalker\u0026spell=flicker\u0026emblem=assassin\u0026talents=rupture%2Cmaster-assassin%2Ckilling-spree\u0026flex=rose-gold-meteor.windtalker%2Cthunder-belt.windtalker%2Cblade-of-despair.sea-halberd\"},{\"slot\":2,\"id\":\"jungle-tempo\",\"name\":\"Jungle Tempo\",\"roleContext\":\"Jungle\",\"items\":[{\"slug\":\"swift-boots\",\"name\":\"Swift Boots\",\"cost\":710,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"corrosion-scythe\",\"name\":\"Corrosion Scythe\",\"cost\":2050,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"demon-hunter-sword\",\"name\":\"Demon Hunter Sword\",\"cost\":2180,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"golden-staff\",\"name\":\"Golden Staff\",\"cost\":2000,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"sea-halberd\",\"name\":\"Sea Halberd\",\"cost\":2050,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"rose-g